# The tag pick list on the deepest path to an item form: the location
# tree, the contents of Box B2 with everything below it, item 2 there in
# its form, edited, the pick list of its Tags field, and the help over
# that.  Each list on the way is paged to its end and back first (End,
# Home), so that it holds its ring of page cursors.
#@ DEEP
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
T B
K END HOME DOWN DOWN ENTER END HOME ENTER CTRL-E PGDN UP F4 END HOME
S DEEPTAG
K F1
S DEEPTHLP
K ESC ESC ESC
T Y
K ESC ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
